        "type": "qcm",
        "answer": "n(n+1)/2",
        "correction": "Somme des n premiers entiers = n(n+1)/2 (suite arithmétique de premier terme 1, raison 1)."
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "question_id": 5,
        "type": "vrai-faux",
        "answer": "vrai",
        "correction": "r > 0 → uₙ₊₁ = uₙ + r > uₙ : la suite est strictement croissante."
